le":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720828005:1":{"text":"이런 걸 실력이라고 하지, 친구. 머리를 좀 더 쓰고 전략과 심리전이라도 공부해 보면 이해하게 될 거야.","source_cn":"这叫牌技，亲爱的朋友。多动动脑子，用上点计谋和心理战术...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E907009E4D40F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720828006:1":{"text":"혹시 현실에서도 머리에 묘비를 달고 다니는 건 아니지?","source_cn":"毕竟你又不是一块真正的墓碑，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A4C26F9F9EE260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720828007:1":{"text":"너...","source_cn":"你——<key:dialog21>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F1D5B9FC2CD630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720828008:1":{"text":"자, 나는 블루 칩을 바꾸러 가보지. 그럼 이만.","source_cn":"现在——如果您不介意的话——我要先走一步，去兑换青符了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9FFDA516084952D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720828009:1":{"text":"손님, 잠시만요.","source_cn":"这位顾客，请留步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E48E43311A1A742","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720828010:1":{"text":"...왜, 블루 칩에 문제가 있나? 아니면 은월관에서도 내가 무슨 수작질을 했다고 생각하는 건가?","source_cn":"……怎么，青符有问题？还是说，会馆也认为我赢得不光彩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42762BBAD2A3F143","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720828011:1":{"text":"오해십니다.","source_cn":"不，您误会了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x006E0F1BBD9B38CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720828012:1":{"text":"관주님께서 손님을 뵙고 싶어 하십니다.","source_cn":"是我们的馆主，他想要见您一面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E2B2924467A07A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720828013:1":{"text":"관주가?!","source_cn":"馆主？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF059F7AFDF5634F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720828014:1":{"text":"은월관에 꽤 오래 드나들었지만 한 번도 본 적 없는데...","source_cn":"来了会馆这么久，我还从没见过他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47369A19FF3CD3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1720828015:1":{"text":"요즘 꽤 많이 이기긴 했지만, 이 정도로 관주가 나설 일은 아닐 텐데?","source_cn":"我最近是赢了不少，但就这点数量，还不至于惊动霁月会馆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1B8CCE7AA324A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1720828016:1":{"text":"걱정하시는 바는 이해합니다만, 은월관은 모든 손님의 안전과 정당한 수익을 보장하고 있습니다.","source_cn":"您的担心我能够理解，我们向您承诺，会馆会保证每一位顾客...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30BF4E116AF54C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1720828017:1":{"text":"이쪽으로 모시지요.","source_cn":"请跟我来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4995F7ADC9C77F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1720828018:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1720828019:1":{"text":"빛나는 꽃이 안내인을 따라가는 동시에, 대들보 위에 앉아 있던 까마귀 한 마리가 날개를 퍼덕이며 날아올라 2층으로 향했다.","source_cn":"荧荧花跟上司宾的同时，一只端坐在横梁上的乌鸦扑打双翼，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF8271E3201493F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1720828020:1":{"text":"관주님, 손님을 모셔 왔습니다. 그럼 저는 이만.","source_cn":"馆主，顾客已经到了。那么，我先继续回去工作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4131BADC0DDDDBE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1720828021:1":{"text":"수고했소, 루미.","source_cn":"辛苦了，梅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5BDBDA4710E0ABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1720828022:1":{"text":"은월관에 온 것을 환영하오, 발렌.","source_cn":"欢迎光临霁月会馆，维伦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0A50C2F675CD103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1720828023:1":{"text":"개인적인 대화인 만큼, 본래 모습으로 이야기하는 게 어떻겠소?","source_cn":"既然这是一场私人会谈，就让我们以原本的面貌交流，如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09AC2FA27007615F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1720828024:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1720828025:1":{"text":"처음 뵙겠소. 은월관의 관주, 에린도르라 하오.","source_cn":"初次见面，在下名为埃德加，是霁月会馆的馆主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81301AEA04CCCD31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1720828026:1":{"text":"이름을 알고 있는 것에 놀라지 않는구려.","source_cn":"阁下似乎对我知道你名字这件事并不惊讶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EE4F418C9E6B35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1720828027:1":{"text":"은월관의 관주가 손님의 정보를 알고 있는 게 이상할 건 없지.","source_cn":"霁月会馆的馆主，对顾客的信息了如指掌，不是很正常吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A181A3658D5EF43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1720828028:1":{"text":"물론, 내가 평범한 관주라면 불가능했을 것이오.","source_cn":"呵……倘若在下只是寻常的馆主，是做不到这件事的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911012527DE47761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1720828029:1":{"text":"그대도 알고 있지 않소?","source_cn":"你同样清楚这点，不是么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04033E7556DCBBC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1720828030:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1720828031:1":{"text":"조언을 하나 하겠소. 은월관에서는 자신의 가치를 드러내는 것이, 약한 모습을 보이는 것보다 훨씬 유용하오.","source_cn":"不妨听听我的建议：在会馆，展现自己的价值，远比示弱有用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD8B386BB51E016B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1720828032:1":{"text":"사바나에 비밀 정보 조직이 있다는 얘기는 들었어. 방대한 정보 수집망을 가지고 각종 분야에 손을 뻗고 있다지?","source_cn":"我只听说赛凡纳里有个秘密的情报组织，他们有一套规模庞大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046C7FA1E7855050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1720828033:1":{"text":"그리고 마침 은월관에서는 다양한 정보를 얻을 수 있고... 내가 아는 건 그것뿐이야.","source_cn":"而霁月会馆恰巧是个消息很灵通的地方。仅此而已，别的我什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F52A2B94D6A4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1720828034:1":{"text":"호오? 그렇다면 특별히 몇 가지 정보는 특별히 무료로 내어 드리리다.","source_cn":"哦？既然如此，我便再无偿赠送你几条情报吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C6AD4BEFC22BA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1720828035:1":{"text":"그대가 말한 정보 조직은 “은둔자”라 하오.","source_cn":"你口中的情报组织的确存在，其名为“隐士”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FDF70D8A6FAFCC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1720828036:1":{"text":"그리고 은월관은 은둔자의 거점 중 하나라오. 나는 은월관의 관주이자 은둔자의 통솔자이기도 하지.","source_cn":"而霁月会馆，正是隐士的根据地之一。在下管理着会馆，同时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3E53E3C9DF888F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record